# MUST BE INCONSISTENT: realisesLayer is functional. A technology realises the
# services of one layer; a protocol spanning two is modelled as two
# technologies.
@prefix iso7498: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498#> .
@prefix inst: <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances#> .
@prefix ex: <https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
<https://w3id.org/aias/example/iso7498/neg04> a owl:Ontology ;
    owl:imports <https://w3id.org/aias/odp/iso7498/instances/2.0.0> .
ex:SomeTech a iso7498:Technology ;
    iso7498:realisesLayer inst:NetworkLayer , inst:TransportLayer .
